<title>USA: Cambrex mulling B-3 business options.</title>
<headline>Cambrex mulling B-3 business options.</headline>
<dateline>EAST RUTHERFORD, N.J. 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cambrex Corp said Thursday that it has retained Bavier, Bulger &amp; Goodyear, a management consulting firm, to develop options for the Vitamin B-3 business of its subsidiary, Nepera Inc.</p>
<p>The company said that the Vitamin B-3 business is not meeting its financial goals and that Bavier will focus on developing strategic alternatives to improve future performance.</p>
</text>
